            "image": "shopify://shop_images/81z79y3mTTL.jpg",
            "text": "<h5>Comfortable</h5><p>“This office chair is very comfortable and easy to assemble. The back support is great for long hours of work, and the chair feels sturdy and high quality. I also like the modern design and adjustable features. Overall, it was a great purchase and I would recommend it.”</p>",
