          }
        },
        "testimonial_KkLcpE": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61wE3ZZ8gfL.jpg",
            "text": "<h5>It’s very comfortable!!!</h5><p>I love it, I have been using it from week and yes it gives me so much comfort then my previous chair. First of all it looks good not like bulky chair. It took my 20 minutes to install, it was really easy, all was already installed you just need to put them all together. The quality is nice, I like the cushion it’s very comfortable. It has good features. I like the arms you actually can move as per your choise. It has good reclining. It gives my back good support which I really needed. Overall love it and recommended. Thanks</p>",
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/XK.png",
            "author": "Schadenfreudist",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-atlas-ergonomic-high-back-mesh-office-chair-bifma-certified"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LNDFkk": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71C3pdQPj1L.jpg",
            "text": "<h5>Excellent upgrade</h5><p>Did my research as I always do and pulled trigger on Colamy Atlas. Not sure what paying $500-1000 for a chair would get me, but this chair has all the same features and a very nice build quality for under $300.Seat cushion has right amount of firmness and contour of back higher end chairs. Lumbar works but is nothing substantial as this is a personal preference. The mechanisms and arm adjustments are solid.Worth a consideration if you are in market for a great chair but don't want to drop $500 to $1000 as I think this can compete as long as you take out branding and prestige. You can pay $2000 for a chair that is uncomfortable for your needs.</p>",
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/ACF05.png",
            "author": "Schadenfreudist",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-atlas-ergonomic-high-back-mesh-office-chair-bifma-certified"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_kHN6B9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71nUyvoXroL.jpg",
            "text": "<h5>Outstanding office chair at a great price point</h5><p>The parts and materials of the chair feel strong and durable, and I don't think that there will be any issues of premature wear or breaking. I feel confident in the longetivty of this chair so far. Upon sitting on the chair for the first time, I knew there and then that I made the right decision in purchasing this office chair. It's super comfortable and the ergonomic design was good to my liking. The adjustments you can do on the chair was also well though of and such a breeze. For example, I adjusted the tension of how easy it would be to lean back and rock back and forth.</p>",
            "author": "Hally G",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-atlas-ergonomic-high-back-mesh-office-chair-bifma-certified"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_ix6XTx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "text": "<h5>Excellent Chair – Super Comfortable and Sturdy</h5><p>I’m very happy with this computer chair! The assembly was quick and easy, and all the parts were well packed. The chair feels very sturdy and well made.The seat cushion is thick and comfortable, even after sitting for long hours. The back support is great and really helps with posture. The height adjustment works smoothly, and the wheels roll quietly without scratching the floor.Overall, this chair offers amazing comfort and quality for the price. Perfect for working, studying, or gaming. I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable office chair!</p>",
            "author": "Zagi",
            "bio": "",
            "product": "colamy-atlas-ergonomic-high-back-mesh-office-chair-bifma-certified"
          }
        }
      },
